NOTICE
======

This repository contains an unofficial English translation layer for ApkStart.

Upstream project
----------------
ApkStart
https://github.com/RoutineMiku/apkstart
Copyright (c) RoutineMiku
License: MIT (https://github.com/RoutineMiku/apkstart/blob/main/LICENSE)

Files derived from ApkStart:
- i18n/manual.en.html (translated from the upstream built-in manual)
- i18n/en-merged.json, i18n/en-data.js (dictionary based on the Chinese UI strings,
  with translations from upstream PR #84 by Chomper9981, extended here)
- patch/example-*.json (translated copies of the bundled driver examples)

The installer copies ApkStart from the user's own Microsoft Store installation. No
ApkStart binaries are redistributed by this repository.

Translation contributors
------------------------
- English dictionary seed: PR #84 "feat(i18n): 界面多语言 English / Tiếng Việt / 中文"
